    {
      "page_idx": 18,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.093,
            0.034,
            0.506,
            0.093
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "What's Next for You?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.085,
            0.169,
            0.591,
            0.215
          ],
          "content": "■Many of you have worked very hard"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.105,
            0.22,
            0.561,
            0.263
          ],
          "content": "\\- Rest of the staff and I appreciate it"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.085,
            0.289,
            0.671,
            0.333
          ],
          "content": "■ Only you know your return on investment"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.105,
            0.339,
            0.54,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": "\\- Take a look at early problem sets"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.105,
            0.387,
            0.702,
            0.433
          ],
          "content": "\\- Think about what you’d be willing tackle now"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.085,
            0.459,
            0.849,
            0.505
          ],
          "content": "■Remember that you can write programs to get answers"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.085,
            0.527,
            0.809,
            0.618
          ],
          "content": "■There are other CS courses you are prepared to take\n◦ 6.009, 6.005, 6.006, 6.034"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.085,
            0.645,
            0.461,
            0.691
          ],
          "content": "■Find and interesting UROP"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.085,
            0.715,
            0.263,
            0.757
          ],
          "content": "■ Minor in CS"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.085,
            0.783,
            0.261,
            0.828
          ],
          "content": "■ Major in CS"
        },
        {
